# Audit Trail Protocol

When performing AI-SDLC work, maintain an append-only audit trail in `.aidlc/audit.md`.

## What to Log

- **Gate decisions**: Approval or rejection with evidence summary
- **Deviations**: Any departure from the plan (auto-fixes, scope changes, blocked tasks)
- **Verification results**: Pass/fail with evidence links
- **Plan decisions**: Why tasks were ordered, grouped, or deferred

## Entry Format

```markdown
### Entry [N] — [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM]
**Type:** [gate|deviation|verification|decision]
**Context:** [phase/unit/task]
**Description:** [what happened]
**Evidence:** [links or inline proof]
**Actor:** [AI|Human]
```

## Rules

- Never delete or modify existing entries
- Always append at the end
- Include timestamps
- Be specific — "verified" is not enough, say what was verified and how
